# Build context of the setup image only: what setup/Dockerfile copies. (The main image's .dockerignore does not let
# setup/ into its context at all, so nothing here can end up in the worker / api / ui image.)
*
!setup/requirements.txt
!setup/manifest.json
!setup/fetch_weights.py
!setup/models.py
!setup/service.py
!setup/test_service.py
!src/carparking/__init__.py
!src/carparking/geometry/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
